| control | actual nearest original id | stored count |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| duplicate/equal-distance tie | 0 | 3 |
| subnormal distances | 1 | 2 |
| extreme distances | 1 | 2 |

| query control | actual returned count |
| --- | ---: |
| k zero | 0 |
| k exceeds size | 3 |
